{"sourceUrl":"https://mks.tyut.edu.cn/info/1056/8114.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:17.242846+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mks.tyut.edu.cn/info/1056/8114.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>马克思主义学院</span></span><span><span>接收</span>20</span><span>27<span>届优秀本科毕业生</span></span></p><p><span><span>免试攻读硕士研究生工作</span></span><span><span>安排</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>为</span></span><span><span>做好我院</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span>2027<span>届</span></span><span><span>优秀本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作，加强高层次拔尖创新专门人才选拔培养，进一步提高我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>研究生的生源质量</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>根据教育部</span></span><span><span>、山西省招生考试管理中心</span></span><span><span>和学校</span></span><span><span>有关</span></span><span><span>文件和工作</span></span><span><span>要求</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>接收</span></span><span><span>推荐免试研究生</span></span><span><span>工作</span></span><span><span>安排</span></span><span><span>如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、接收专业</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>专业代码</span>        <span>专业名称</span></span></p><p><span>     030500       <span>马克思主义理论</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>应届本科毕业生，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，诚实守信，品德良好。</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.<span>必须获得所在本科学校</span></span><span><span>当年</span></span><span><span>推荐免试资格</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>且在</span></span><span><span>教育部</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>注册</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>报名成功。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、接收程序</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>有意报考我院的推免生将申请材料的电子版（</span></span><span>全部材料放到一</span><span><span>个文件</span></span><span>里</span><span><span>，文件名</span></span><span>以</span><span><span>学生姓名</span></span><span><span>命名，</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式</span></span><span><span>）于</span>9<span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日中午</span><span>12</span><span>点前发送到马克思主义学院</span><span>E-Mail</span><span>（</span><span>tyutmks@163.com</span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>所有报考我院的推免生须在</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日登录中国研招网开通的</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>免初试、转段</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>信息公开管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称推免系统）填写报考志愿，所报研究生专业应与本科学习专业相同或相近。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学院审核申请信息，并联系审核通过的推免生确定复试资格、复试时间和复试地点。推免生根据学院要求参加复试考核，复试合格后我院上报我校研究生院备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span>.<span>研究生院通过该</span><span>“</span><span>推免系统</span><span>”</span><span>和学院报送的接收名单审核推免生报名志愿，对符合申请条件者发送待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、复试</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>复试采用面试方式进行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>复试时间及地点学院将以电话方式通知申请人</span></span><span>，请注意接听</span><span><span>。学院</span></span><span>将在</span><span>9<span>月</span><span>23</span><span>日前完成考核工作</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、申请人提交材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>推免生在</span></span><span><span>参加考核</span></span><span><span>时</span></span><span><span>需</span></span><span><span>提供以下材料原件和复印件，原件由学院审核，学院成立材料审核专家组，每组不少于</span>3<span>人</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>专家按照材料审核办法和工作要求</span></span><span><span>进行审核。</span></span><span><span>所有</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>复印件统一用</span>A4<span>纸张复印</span></span><span><span>并提交</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>留存，</span></span><span><span>提交后</span></span><span><span>不予</span></span><span><span>退还。</span></span><span><span>推免生</span></span><span><span>须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，如提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消</span></span><span><span>其考核</span></span><span><span>录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>个人基本信息情况及申请攻读研究生报告（推免生本人准备）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科成绩单（学生所在学校教务</span></span><span><span>部门盖章</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本科期间</span></span><span><span>重要</span></span><span><span>获奖证书、学术论文及科研成果等材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>外语</span></span><span><span>等级考试</span></span><span><span>成绩</span></span><span><span>证书（或成绩证明）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>其他获得推免资格的相关证明材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>六、</span></span><span>其他</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>被我校正式录取的推免生，不再参加</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>研究生</span></span><span><span>统考</span></span><span><span>及复试</span></span><span><span>录取环节，我校将于</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>年</span>6<span>月下旬寄发录取通知书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>申请人在推荐免试过程中如有弄虚作假行为，我校不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>已被我校录取的推免生如在入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书，</span></span><span><span>经核实后</span></span><span><span>将取消其录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>推免生须符合普通高等学校招生体检标准，录取报到后需参加我校校医院体检，不合格者取消录取资格。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>马克思主义学院联系人：郭老师</span></span></p><p><span>E-Mail:tyutmks@163.com</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"9de795eab8df14dcc26f1d24e3e37594807977d17a9b28286b69dce1ee1215e2","textLength":1132,"sourceSha256":"41dca64fa46d44a5b853da384eaba0c536b627e469db9aa9e91e149fbf461647","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e03213db72137e53bc04","title":"2026年太原理工大学马克思主义学院接收2027届优秀本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:17.242846+00:00"}
